{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c90303a5575527df4bbcac52dd71953bbaf8364923d37be30b302df15cc4e1f8", "ja": "『アイメガ』のリハで、響と翼は玲音と詩花\nのステージに打ちのめされる。このままでは\n勝てない、心を合わせなければ……プロデュ\nーサーに諭されたふたりは本当のデュオにな\nるため、お互いを理解し始めるのだった。", "zh": "在“偶像大赏”彩排中，响与翼被玲音和诗花\n的舞台彻底击垮。这样下去赢不了，\n必须同心协力才行……在制作人的规劝下，\n两人为了成为真正的二人组合，\n开始试着去理解彼此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "569c68d715fe2d5d6086eb91483b978f59a0c9fac350a97e43ce5bbda5394078", "ja": "（『アイメガ』全体リハ当日。響と翼のステージ\nリハは、大きなトラブルもなく無事に終わった）", "zh": "（『偶像大赛』全员彩排当天。响和翼的舞台彩排顺利结束了，没有遇到什么大问题）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "65c24894e84d3feaa9a9f1136cc5fedc5cba652e4a45d2d3e909bfeaa6ff7500", "ja": "（そして今、玲音と詩花のステージも\n無事に終わったのだが……）", "zh": "（然后现在，玲音和诗花的舞台也顺利结束了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "883a46b73c52cc0bd216e9ed4ee961a869e375d7d55f31ba2416cde4a68f0236", "ja": "はぁぁ………………。", "zh": "哈啊………………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fd793ba70897511dc41248a2c8f1ebdc9610dfebd7a615815c88f695ffbe5a84", "ja": "わぁぁ………………。", "zh": "哇啊………………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ec923a586e632862dbbf488f9847530d1256aa701990b9d1206d9109f0997384", "ja": "……なんだろう。荘厳というか、美しく力強いというか\n神秘的というか、スケール感があるというか……。", "zh": "……该怎么说呢。感觉既庄严，又优美强劲，\n既神秘，又很有格局……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "f3a1774c8b03385083fc2ac92a9e84683267ff70af7ec2ab0e2df4290bb14b88", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと{$P$}！？\n敵のステージを褒めまくってどうするの！？", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！？\n你一个劲儿夸敌人的舞台干什么呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ad1830d17c47bc9a5790fa361c77deb2be829d95b5eaac1c09e605c9255cf503", "ja": "あっ、ごめん、つい感じたまま口に出してしまって！\n……でも、実際いいステージだったよな？", "zh": "啊，抱歉，我一不小心就把心里的感受直接说出来了！\n……不过，实际上那确实是很棒的舞台吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f4f34c8b9e129557813272910461cd83b40adc486540b1319b26391846a2cdc", "ja": "そうですよね～。二人の息もピッタリで、動きも綺麗に\n重なって……。響さんも見とれてましたよね？", "zh": "就是啊～。两个人配合得天衣无缝，动作也漂亮地重合在一起……响也看入迷了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "2912d51df77d1f77deb59ee08c7dae99d25d4783b4febc47f87fb3003c5b49da", "ja": "うぐっ。そ、そうだけど……でも感心してちゃダメだ！\n自分達は、勝たなきゃいけないんだってばー！", "zh": "唔。虽、虽然是这样……但可不能光顾着佩服！\n我们可是必须赢下来的啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "caf7889b4a8dff3c6e0446d26d38afed1d8a7df45a92510016713de07217af75", "ja": "そうだな……。ちょっと出遅れたかもしれないけど、\nまだ時間はある。これから……うん？", "zh": "是啊……虽然可能稍微落后了一点，不过还有时间。接下来……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1010_202xxx", "source_sha256": "063c027985fed3cda56506be422111fcb0422780f10b5fb60087759dfc7976a7", "ja": "やあ、我那覇、伊吹、それからキミも！\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "嗨，我那霸、伊吹，还有你也是！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1011_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9c1b9bd0b16957229a2b36b29d23f3078b529829820ca2484553fc3971b57975", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪\nみなさん、私たちのステージ、いかがでしたか？", "zh": "格吕斯·戈特♪\n大家觉得我们的舞台怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a7c745406a9dc16aea907593c7f8bf7723b46f6c9375d4b3f57bbf6c441eba6c", "ja": "ああ……二人ともお疲れさま。\n正直なところ、驚いたよ。仕上がりが早いんだな。", "zh": "啊……你们两个都辛苦了。\n说实话，真让我吃了一惊。你们准备得真快啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1013_202xxx", "source_sha256": "3e1ff7b28bb341cdc1344a0fefbd3e8e016a6b437e1d1cb544e86d7d235e8c21", "ja": "あはは、悪いけど、それなりに準備はしてきたからね。\nデュオユニットとしてのデビューになるわけだし。", "zh": "啊哈哈，不好意思，毕竟我也做足了相应的准备呢。\n而且这也算是作为双人组合的出道演出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1014_201xxx", "source_sha256": "75bf3d2c79ffe29fe5e91a597075a9870fde25229c025ac1e09498afe8883f7a", "ja": "それじゃ、ステージは楽しんでいただけたんですね？\nよかった……頑張った甲斐がありました♪", "zh": "那么，您很享受这次舞台呢？  \n太好了……我的努力没有白费♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "3d2abc9b50a393f8954e665eeacfe012509155e83d027f39347b948b62ce2e91", "ja": "そ、そうだね……わ、悪くなかった……ぞ？\nでも自分達だって、負けてなかったでしょ！？", "zh": "嗯、嗯，是啊……也、也不算差……吧？不过，我们也没输给你们吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1016_202xxx", "source_sha256": "700412f09f08a62094cf46034099102c3dc36ca872cd26aa05271fe039e3e197", "ja": "そうなの我那覇？　キミ達の今日の出来で、\nアタシ達に勝つつもり？　あれで満足なの？", "zh": "是这样吗，我那霸？就凭你们今天的表现，也想赢过我们？那样就满足了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "ac32231c524f78081ada37e9349907dc8b6fd251c007c176e6b6e712add3f7d7", "ja": "うぐ……っ！", "zh": "呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a51fdecb8dd34ce26b302dd5ac72dff510d98e4f1cebe9a9b8f506302565b91a", "ja": "響さん……。", "zh": "响……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "86f874b265b726d68b948fe5b670c8110d0fd17ef40a927bc95a48522a2c78c8", "ja": "もうっ、お姉さま！？\nどうしてそういういい方になるんですか！", "zh": "真是的，姐姐大人！？\n为什么要那么说嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1020_kuroi", "source_sha256": "7c1ea5eeea10072867c8968ba373039dfb1502fa804a6fd87e4873d50fca2be1", "ja": "ハーハハハ！　これはどうしたのかな？　ずいぶん\nしょぼくれたアイドルがいるようじゃあないか？", "zh": "哈哈哈哈！这是怎么了？好像有个偶像垂头丧气的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5e45db8b1e7307b781ba9e4f5c014064e37f9602e9ca23aa7c6e206bd100df27", "ja": "黒井社長……！", "zh": "黑井社长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1022_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2cf2fcb8926cc59844830924342554b49201f27b1b90ef3e7e4279e5f6fad4cc", "ja": "うう、こんな時に社長まで……。", "zh": "呜呜，偏偏在这种时候，连社长也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1023_kuroi", "source_sha256": "0d5484b1a316ae2ace523643e83bd2bfcf2f1d5bf30ffc393d98c9ce2acf73c7", "ja": "まあ、無理もない。今日のステージでどちらが上だった\nかは、ハムスターの目にも明らかだからな！", "zh": "这也难怪。毕竟在今天的舞台上谁更胜一筹，\n就连仓鼠看了都一清二楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1024_kuroi", "source_sha256": "77f4121574b6d222268621160093807e9d7d19d835ef98001314927cff9678eb", "ja": "完勝圧勝絶勝！　パーフェクト・ゲェェェェェェェム！\nいや、勝負にもならなかったか。フハーッハハハハハ！", "zh": "完胜压胜绝胜！完美——比——赛！\n不对，根本称不上是一场较量吧。哇——哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1025_kuroi", "source_sha256": "1529175dce4d65eef167b7056b1d58f1f9efdecbcdd459e2d97e565df54b27fa", "ja": "だが安心したまえ。貴様たちがヘボいのは、本人の才能\nや素質のせいだけでもない。プロデューサーの問題だ！", "zh": "不过，放心吧。你们之所以不中用，也不全是因为本人的才能\n和资质。这是制作人的问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1027_kuroi", "source_sha256": "002c46238b845d7c2d2926a781bcd0a9d733d4c51e84115d84268d521fcc7510", "ja": "落ち込むヒマがあったら、そこのヘッポコ虫くらいしか\n用意できない、765プロの弱小ぶりを嘆くことだな！", "zh": "与其在那里消沉，不如好好感叹一下，\n连那只窝囊虫都只能勉强凑合的\n765制作人有多弱小吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1028_kuroi", "source_sha256": "db950d6d9a3de3f310f428a9399fda17011e3f1f2b89a2dcf3297c0d3f9cb77f", "ja": "なんなら、ウチに移籍しても構わんぞ？\n特別に、鍛え直してやろう。ハーッハハハハハハ！", "zh": "如果你愿意，转到我们这边来也无妨吧？\n就破例让我来重新锻炼你吧。哈——哈哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e8c0daa6846b68c45770881b91604b9f2d4bf5f1e4f71aabf2da9f58c3d7a8dc", "ja": "……そうですね、責任はプロデューサーにあります。\nただ、その前が違う。響と翼は何ひとつヘボくない！", "zh": "……确实，责任全在制作人身上。\n但是，你前面的话不对。响和翼没有任何一处差劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1030_kuroi", "source_sha256": "9f5cf5d5b0afbd2c7d27df7b563111c35d35282db488a4a9c3eb3b2de7b20aa1", "ja": "フン！　また甘いことを……この四流のミジンコが！\nそんなものは誰のためにも、救いにもならない感傷だ！", "zh": "哼！又在说这种天真的话……你这个四流的水蚤！  \n那种东西既不是为了任何人，也不是能带来救赎的感伤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1031_kuroi", "source_sha256": "dcf573a15de0dad17ced7fb7d441b15fdd6a105e179a7c4e90e491b1036ff1d8", "ja": "もういい。お前と話すのは時間のムダでしかない。\n玲音、詩花、行くぞ！", "zh": "够了。跟你说话纯粹是浪费时间。\n玲音、诗花，我们走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1032_202xxx", "source_sha256": "15cb193838b26b84ef1319b434a1592d2a0cc78a9f9d0e0751f415338cf287ec", "ja": "我那覇、伊吹。次に会うのは本番だけど、今のままじゃ\n社長のいう通り、勝負にならないと思うな。それじゃ。", "zh": "我那霸、伊吹。下次见面就是正式演出了，不过照现在这样，我觉得正如社长所说，根本没法一决胜负。那就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1033_201xxx", "source_sha256": "df1a0fd222089c3e630d5fb09bf3a4fa258d64832e08c9b351b00249874549ea", "ja": "また……失礼なことばかり、本当にすみません。あの、\n本番でのお二人のステージ、楽しみにしていますね！", "zh": "她又……说了这么多失礼的话，真的非常抱歉。那个，\n我很期待两位在正式演出时的舞台表现哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "65ecb5a327c5d61cc4ffb652c6ad2db22d121ebc82b5f3d52f6a555ba331ef00", "ja": "（全体リハが終わり、劇場に帰ってきたものの……\n二人はかなりショックを引きずっている）", "zh": "（全员彩排结束后，虽然回到了剧场……\n但两个人似乎还深受打击）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "19c3c317c7ab2c144f90a96ff8e2a0df2202c56026f15de4cd59977fe6857564", "ja": "ううっ……どうしたらいいんだ～！\nあの二人に勝つには……勝つには……うぎぎぎ～！", "zh": "呜呜……到底该怎么办才好啊～！\n要想赢过那两个人……要想赢过她们……呜吱吱吱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16df7985487dfd42eba83e5b83d017fd5541ba3e9f461b326116e62b096fd61b", "ja": "響さん、落ち着いてくださいよ～。\nデュオなんだから、一緒に考えましょ？", "zh": "响姐，冷静一点嘛～。\n我们可是双人组合，一起想想办法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "77d4412549ae32577303ecd1d5d9cadfd48209d5230cf08c41987d13d6f0698f", "ja": "うう……もう、単純にレッスンが足りないとか、\nそういう差じゃない気がするぞ……。", "zh": "呜呜……感觉已经不是单纯练习不够\n之类的那种差距了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "380124a3d7636b337b7d5bdac3b8cb4cd4e8be30d83b87c7a223fb6e3c4889d4", "ja": "まあ、二人とも元気を出して。今日の玲音と詩花の\nステージには、たしかに圧倒されたけど。", "zh": "好了，你们两个都打起精神来。今天玲音和詩花的舞台确实让人叹为观止，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9459101f69b4357e7507fd06fed99806a6619701328108efefcc539c702396d5", "ja": "よく考えたら、今の時点で二人が負けているのは……\nまあ、当たり前だと思うんだ。", "zh": "仔细想想，在这个时候你们两个人输掉……我觉得也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "036175523c45ae0d0436b58e27405b4f9c0c6d07e4029ae5835e595602c2485d", "ja": "えーっ！？\n{$P$}さん、ひどーい！", "zh": "诶——！？\n{$P$}先生，太过分了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1043_013hib", "source_sha256": "49b46693978c84744fb8d4bf7f2ef7cac9ba837e554c5326d8aea1698bfbdee7", "ja": "{$P$}、なんてコトいうんだ！？\nもうご飯も編み物も作ってあげないぞっ！？", "zh": "{$P$}，你在说什么啊！？我再也不给你做饭，也不给你织东西了哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "794da42a79522e0486c93513d3d07c518e6d9b86ce65610931b909f2085b13a4", "ja": "いや、まだ続きがあって。ほら、今日の玲音と詩花は\nデュオとして完全に仕上げてきてただろう？", "zh": "不，我还没说完呢。你看，今天的玲音和诗花\n作为双人组合，完成度可以说是相当完美了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3413caffa3521787e4c67fa24400b0ab1694e99c0a91145fa6d89b80a8c3ba8", "ja": "はい……でも、わたし達だって、\n最近ず～っと二人一緒にレッスンしてたんですよ？", "zh": "是的……可是，我们最近也一直在一起练习呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "b4d92fccc5b4c193de0e085895f9af94e00b9cd913ba418c153c75fdba1c329c", "ja": "そうだったな。でも、デュオっていうのはきっと、\nそれだけじゃダメなんだと思う。", "zh": "是这样。不过，我觉得所谓二人组合，光是这样还不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "5e4bf177c759fb4518110597b872579dfd94588e4650f6a67bbbd124b1a08cde", "ja": "お互いが何を考えていて、何をしたいと思ってて、\n何を作り上げるのか。そんな風に……。", "zh": "要了解彼此在想什么、想做什么，以及要共同创造出什么。就像这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "b41897dfe6efd2332d9fbee901ab57811a2310f32d970dd2a8c4b2be58e3e501", "ja": "心を合わせて。\nそれから二人で、しっかり前を向かないと。", "zh": "心意相通。\n然后再两个人一起，坚定地向前看才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1049_013hib", "source_sha256": "409d4be675fbc5aa35ec9f5d89b4f22a5f72e5f911bdf3ad95f1ba4ce9ed580d", "ja": "心を、合わせて……。", "zh": "齐心，协力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1050_016tsu", "source_sha256": "af99c6fdc8e4fb594643d041f7b9a92516cca8637d420cdf8a1b1e6a94892df5", "ja": "それから、前を向いて……？", "zh": "然后，面向前方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1051_p", "source_sha256": "f656febd8c76c23dbb6e5d38954856f339eb8df4961cb10017fd9d2179800f22", "ja": "うん。だから心を合わせて、響と翼がひとつになって\nそこからがデュオの勝負なんだ。そしたら……。", "zh": "嗯。所以要齐心协力，让响和翼融为一体，\n从那之后才是双人组合真正的较量。那样一来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "7f99f5ce21f578e92d5744370c22605d6b85e81e4ee1c91ec227442c67ef24be", "ja": "玲音と詩花どころか、もう誰にも負けない。\nそんな無敵の、最高のデュオになれるかもしれないぞ！", "zh": "别说玲音和诗花了，今后谁都赢不了我们。说不定就能成为无敌的、最棒的双人组合了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1053_013hib", "source_sha256": "1984223d12926cf4798b7e1d5218ffbffe763c70c2c472aac2bcf27ea7ace886", "ja": "そうかな……。そうかも……。うん、そうだよね！\n自分、ちょっと順番を間違えてたぞ。", "zh": "是这样吗……。或许真的是这样……。嗯，确实如此！\n我好像把顺序搞错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1054_013hib", "source_sha256": "326ee1366bcda7aef6c9b9ef60ba42e439c46ee3c67b12fa29f04356aa3d6038", "ja": "玲音たちに勝つことばっかり考えてたけど、違うよね。\nまずは翼と、もっと仲良く……あああああ～～～っ！", "zh": "我之前光想着要赢过玲音她们了，不对吧。\n首先得和翼变得更加要好……啊啊啊啊啊～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1055_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71332457ef3ed630f91e901192161ef5a71938d2119a735d02803aa5e8a7fffa", "ja": "び、ビックリした～。\nどうしたんですか、響さん？", "zh": "吓、吓我一跳～。\n怎么了，响前辈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1056_013hib", "source_sha256": "d8c7508c31cab77749e78236a520fd90727af739c087c32f1d6dc7f306dea0d0", "ja": "そういえば……翼は最初からそう言ってたよね？\nついていきたい～とか、一緒に考えよう～とか！", "zh": "说起来……翼从一开始就是这么说的吧？\n像是“我想跟着你～”“一起想办法吧～”之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "8941ffa699c29b897984d407654fc0b1d7ef2c073f9717960276901fb4dd2f87", "ja": "うぎゃー！　自分はなんてダメなセンパイなんだー！\nこんな自分でゴメン、翼！　嫌いにならないで～！！", "zh": "哇啊——！自己到底算什么差劲的前辈啊——！\n是这样的自己真是对不起，翼！不要讨厌我～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1058_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f29ffa0e670ead273287650491b0055958695b5c42f27501501bbf3610ef964c", "ja": "な、なりませんってば～！\nわたしも、そんな深く考えたわけじゃないし……。", "zh": "不、不会讨厌你的啦～！\n我也没想得那么深……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1059_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7c765f46855047466b227f1b82796028dd09ffaa54593ec0427859c3d30b2943", "ja": "それに響さんと一緒だと、大変だったりするけど、\nでも……楽しくて。だから、大好きで～す♪", "zh": "而且和响小姐在一起，虽然有时候挺辛苦的，\n但是……很开心。所以，我最喜欢了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1060_013hib", "source_sha256": "64a666b36fe92dcf73a1e4daaee575e46a4ebd124e20e4b0c4464733e567aa2c", "ja": "つ、翼……。そんなこと、ハッキリ言われると……\nうう、恥ずかしいぞ～……えへ、えへへへ……。", "zh": "翼……你、你这么直白地说出来……我会很不好意思的啦～……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1061_p", "source_sha256": "49ea98154707005a34b7f4abb96578b0bed78ddffad00580e365fe1fa28b4619", "ja": "……いい笑顔だな、響。", "zh": "……笑得很灿烂呢，响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1062_013hib", "source_sha256": "58022c521afa29c20bb65a43d4ec77ffc945b81d92d0f3091acac4bfe1e991d3", "ja": "うん……、よしっ。翼、ありがとう！\n{$P$}も、ありがとね！", "zh": "嗯……好。翼，谢谢你！\n{$P$}也谢谢你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1063_013hib", "source_sha256": "128da2b7cfd77803787e608b359398faaa880d97b6a01e19e221f891d82a3d69", "ja": "言われた通り、自分達はまず、デュオになろう！\nそれで一気に玲音達に追いついて、それから……", "zh": "就像你说的，咱们先从二人组开始吧！\n这样一口气追上玲音她们，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1064_013hib", "source_sha256": "8b2af5fcab1df3d78ce03d10359af88d1237f149e38d6e56bbde06719edb15b8", "ja": "そのまま一気に追い抜こうね！\n自分と翼で作る、最高のステージで！", "zh": "就这样一口气超过他们吧！\n用我和翼打造的最棒舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1065_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70f646e9a38f56146f4c9540d3b0591baf1b130bb4373d7bcf6af8cd03170239", "ja": "は～い！　そんなことできたら、すごいですもんね♪\nわたし、がんばりま～す♪", "zh": "好～的！要是能做到那种事，就太厉害了♪\n我会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_04_1066_p", "source_sha256": "41f1f99ddbfd84df88824a592052333dea419bbae76fa7b25f0e25ecbecdb56f", "ja": "（デュオとして、二人はお互いを理解し始めた。\nさあ、待ってろよ玲音、詩花！）", "zh": "（作为二人组合，她们开始逐渐理解彼此了。来吧，玲音、诗花，等着瞧吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
